10: Flag to tell if this is the First Scored Particle from this History (1 means true)
11: Run ID
12: Event ID
13: Track ID
14: Initial Kinetic Energy [MeV]
15: Vertex Position X [cm]
16: Vertex Position Y [cm]
17: Vertex Position Z [cm]
18: Initial Direction Cosine X
19: Initial Direction Cosine Y
20: Initial Direction Cosine Z

